            "evidence": [
              "Reviewed all four changed paths in full. No readability defect that hides a concrete problem or makes the change unsafe to maintain.",
              "The backoff constants in engine/review/app/service.go are explained in a comment. The stated 513ms total for sixteen tries matches the schedule: 1+2+4+8+16+32 ms, then nine waits of 50 ms, which is 513 ms.",
              "store in engine/review/app/service.go now returns unnamed results with loop-scoped number and name variables. This removes the earlier named-return shadowing and makes the control flow clearer.",
              "The retry-after-failed-add logic in Bind is isolated in the isWorktreeAt helper. Its doc comment states that any state other than a worktree of the repository at the head, and any git error, counts as no.",
              "The test fakes are documented: worktreeLater, worktreeAnswer, races, and the pauses type. The tests pin the sixteen-try contract with literal 16 values, which is intentional because maxNumberAttempts is unexported and the tests are in an external package."
            ]
